  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Assistance to Flood Affected Communities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overall objective: &lt;/strong&gt;Provide immediate relief to flood affected population of Pakistan through multi-sectoral integrated service provision to stabilize the current situation and initiating medium term recovery actions to link to longer-term development needs while instilling elements of prevention of conflicts and tension at the community level.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expected Result: &lt;/strong&gt;Children have access to education, water, sanitation and hygiene services, and to child protection services, as part of the recovery process.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
